cff-version: 1.2.0
title: DrugTree
message: A visual drug exploration tool with interactive body atlas, molecular structures, and genealogy tracking
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: []
    given-names: chenDeepin
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000
repository-code: https://github.com/chenDeepin/DrugTree
url: https://github.com/chenDeepin/DrugTree
abstract: DrugTree is an interactive platform exploring 7,359 approved small-molecule drugs through a human body atlas. Features include molecular structure visualization via RDKit.js, drug genealogy tracking across generations, disease navigation, and a graph knowledge engine. Data sourced from ChEMBL, DrugBank, PubChem, KEGG, and FDA.
keywords:
  - drug discovery
  - molecular visualization
  - cheminformatics
  - drug genealogy
  - therapeutic classification
  - knowledge graph
license: MIT
date-released: 2024-01-01
